 -->\n        <div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"work\">\n          <div class=\"sz-row\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">SZ</span><div class=\"sz\" id=\"sz\" role=\"slider\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Art size\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"5\" aria-valuenow=\"1\"><span class=\"sz-knob\" id=\"szKnob\"></span><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Size 1\"><i></i></button><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Size 2\"><i></i></button><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Size 3\"><i></i></button><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Size 4\"><i></i></button><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Fill\"><i></i></button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid-btn\" id=\"gridBtn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show all projects as a grid\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/></svg><span class=\"g-open\">All projects</span><span class=\"g-close\">Back to project</span></button></div>\n          <article class=\"proj\" id=\"proj\">\n            <div class=\"proj-top\"><span><span id=\"pjIdx\">01 / 73</span><span class=\"feat-star\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.8l2.7 6 6.5.6-4.9 4.3 1.5 6.4L12 16.8 6.2 20.1l1.5-6.4L2.8 9.4l6.5-.6z\"/></svg>Featured</span></span><span id=\"pjYear\"></span></div>\n            <h2 id=\"pjTitle\">Project</h2>\n            <p id=\"pjMeta\"></p>\n            <div class=\"pj-press\" id=\"pjPress\" hidden><span class=\"pp-lbl\" id=\"ppLbl\">Seen in</span><div class=\"pp-row\" id=\"ppRow\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"proj-foot\"><a id=\"pjLink\" href=\"https://precisiondesign.club\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View on precisiondesign.club ↗</a><small>Arrows: next item</small></div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <!-- PROCESS -->\n        <div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"process\" hidden>\n          <ol class=\"tl\">\n            <li class=\"tl-phase\"><span>Getting started</span></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-step start\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"></span><div class=\"tl-body\"><div class=\"tl-head\"><span class=\"tl-n\">01</span><h3>Inquire</h3></div><p>Pick a service and send the Studio Inquiry form with your references.</p></div></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-step start\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"></span><div class=\"tl-body\"><div class=\"tl-head\"><span class=\"tl-n\">02</span><h3>Deposit</h3></div><p>Pay the deposit on Stripe. It also counts as your consultation fee.</p></div></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-step start\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"></span><div class=\"tl-body\"><div class=\"tl-head\"><span class=\"tl-n\">03</span><h3>Consult</h3></div><p>We talk it through. If you move forward, the deposit goes toward your project.</p></div></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-phase\"><span>Design · 3 draft rounds</span></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-step design\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"></span><div class=\"tl-body\"><div class=\"tl-head\"><span class=\"tl-n\">04</span><h3>Mood Board</h3></div><p>You share your references (like you already have), and we add our own so we are fully aligned on direction before any design begins.</p><span class=\"tl-tag\">Direction set</span></div></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-step design\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"></span><div class=\"tl-body\"><div class=\"tl-head\"><span class=\"tl-n\">05</span><h3>Rough Draft</h3><span class=\"tl-meter\" aria-label=\"Draft round 1 of 3\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><p>The early construction of your logo. If the concept is not feeling right, this is the stage to switch directions.</p><span class=\"tl-tag\">Last chance to switch</span></div></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-lock\" aria-label=\"Concept locked\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg></span><span>Concept locked</span></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-step design\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"></span><div class=\"tl-body\"><div class=\"tl-head\"><span class=\"tl-n\">06</span><h3>Concept Development</h3><span class=\"tl-meter\" aria-label=\"Draft round 2 of 3\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span></div><p>The concept becomes more defined. At this point we cannot switch to a new concept, but you will have essentially unlimited revisions within the current one.</p><span class=\"tl-tag\">Unlimited revisions</span></div></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-step design\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"></span><div class=\"tl-body\"><div class=\"tl-head\"><span class=\"tl-n\">07</span><h3>Refinement</h3><span class=\"tl-meter\" aria-label=\"Draft round 3 of 3\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><p>We dial in the layout, colors, and composition.</p></div></li>\n            <li class=\"tl-step design\"><span class=\"tl-dot\"></span><div class=\"tl-body\"><div class=\"tl-head\"><span class=\"tl-n\">08</span><h3>Finalization</h3></div><p>Everything is prepared and exported so it is print-ready and ready to send.</p><span class=\"tl-tag\">Print-ready files</span></div></li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- STUDIO -->\n        <div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"studio\" hidden>\n          <div class=\"studio\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"lede\">A creative studio for fashion and lifestyle brands. We work across brand identity, apparel graphics, cut-and-sew programs, graphic capsules, packaging, art direction and collection design.</p>\n              <p class=\"clients\">Clients include Earl Sweatshirt, Burna Boy, Joe Freshgoods, Carrots, New Balance, 7-Eleven, Warner Music Group, Sony Music, Dreamville, Roc Nation, XLARGE, Cardi B, Coachella, SNIPES, Skechers, Zumiez and Sprite.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"principles\">\n              <div class=\"glass\"><b>LED BY</b>Jakobi McLemore, formerly a senior graphic designer with work for Warner Music Group and Sony Music.</div>\n              <div class=\"glass\"><b>FEATURED</b>Hypebeast and Complex.</div>\n              <div class=\"glass\"><b>STOCKISTS</b>Japan, Australia and VFiles NYC.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"logos\" aria-label=\"Clients we have worked with\">\n              <span class=\"logos-label\">Worked with</span>\n              <div class=\"logo-row a\"><div class=\"logo-track\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/PrecisionDesignGroup/Files@b99da27d9b237f6faa90fdb6804daed1192b667c/logos/jfg.png\" alt=\"JFG\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/PrecisionDesignGroup/Files@b99da27d9b237f6faa90fdb6804daed1192b667c/logos/dreamville.png\" alt=\"Dreamville\" width=\"273\" height=\"96\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/PrecisionDesignGroup/Files@b99da27d9b237f6faa90fdb6804daed1192b667c/logos/trap-house.png\" alt=\"Trap House\" width=\"160\" height=\"140\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/PrecisionDesignGroup/Files@b99da27d9b237f6faa90fdb6804daed1192b667c/logos/burna-boy.png\" alt=\"Burna Boy\" width=\"116\" height=\"140\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/PrecisionDesignGroup/Files@b99da27d9b237f6faa90fdb6804daed1192b667c/logos/holiday.png\" alt=\"Holiday\" width=\"271\" height=\"70\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/PrecisionDesignGroup/Files@b99da27d9b237f6faa90fdb6804daed1192b667c/logos/matte.png\" alt=\"Matte\" width=\"197\" height=\"1